      "review_description": "Got 4 different quotes, two from solarquotes and the remaining two from web site searching. Solarquotes suppliers offered the best system such as Sunpower Maxeons 3 with Fronius Primo $12000 &  REC Alpha Black series with Fronius Primo $11400 (without rebate being added). One of the web supplier offered Sunpower Performance & Enphase inverter $9700 and the last one Hytech offered Q-cells Duo-6+ with Fronius Primo $9300 (also without rebate being added). Following to solarquotes brands of solar panels and inverter being sold in the market and finally Hytech was the winner. In the coming future, a battery wall may be considered to be integrated to the PV system as 2025 owners will be charged solar power to the power grid. Sound like contradictory of government left hand smatch to the right hand. Crazy politicians and government.",
