      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales made lots of promises about how well the system is going to work and that my current bills were going to be equal or less than what i pay now for power of the grid. The bills have gone through the roof and had doubled from the get go. They assured me that by giving it a couple of months I will see improvement. The bills have slightly dropped but only by a few dollars.After 12 months they decided to add 65% more panels and an upgrade of 5kw for free the install has been done and the bills still have not dropped. I have questioned the workings of the system but get not much from them.Now with the government deciding to bring the feed in power down to 6.7 cent per kw, the bills will again skyrocket.I wish i never touched solar.i have never seen a bill for the unit and have not seen any proof of my $4800.00 government rebate.They said they collected it but have no proof of it coming of my total.Hytech Solar, I want my invoice! Show me the proof.",
